{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6ce3d928-d4de-8a03-8999-f7b5bab43a72",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:48:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carol Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. Um, I'm calling about the plowing on my street. It hasn't been done, well, it was done, but only just, and it's..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Annandale Road. 229 Annandale Road, up in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Annandale, 229. Got it. And when you say it was just done, was that this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:31-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, about eight or so. After the storm Friday and Saturday, two days ago now. It's a dead end, you see, so we're always the last one plowed. Always. And it's still pretty narrow down at the end where I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, dead ends tend to go last, the trucks do the through streets first. So it's narrow, but it's been plowed once at least."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Once, yes. There's a hard packed layer left, it's icy, and I, um, I'd like to ask for sand. If somebody could bring some by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:47:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll put in a sand request for Annandale Road. Let me write that down. Two twenty-nine Annandale, icy and packed, sand requested. Is it the whole street or just the end?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:47:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The end mostly, by the turnaround. And the hill part before it, a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:47:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Turnaround and the slope before it. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:47:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry, one second. [pause] I'm a birdwatcher, and there's a cardinal at my feeder right now. Beautiful. Okay. Sorry, I'm back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:47:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, that's a good one to see in the snow. Do you want a call back when the sand goes out, or just leave it with the request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:47:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the request is fine. Though, my number is 401-555-0197 if they need it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:47:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one nine seven, got it. I'll send this over to the crew supervisor this morning. They'll sand as they get to it, probably today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:48:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. That's all I needed. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:48:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Carol. Take care."
    }
  ],
